OL,3,AZelensky gives Melania Trump Ukraine's
OL,4,Ahighest award after Oleshky ceasefire
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas given the country's highest award
OL,8,Ffor women to the US First Lady, Melania
OL,9,FTrump.
OL,11,FThe Order of Princess Olga, 1st Class,
OL,12,Fwas awarded to Melania Trump for her
OL,13,F"significant personal contribution to
OL,14,Fhumanitarian support for Ukraine",
OL,15,Faccording to the presidential decree.
OL,17,FIt comes after the end of ceasefire in
OL,18,FUkraine's southern region of Kherson,
OL,19,Fwhich allowed for the evacuation of
OL,20,Fseveral hundred people from the
OL,21,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
