OL,3,AZelensky gives Melania Trump Ukraine's
OL,4,Ahighest award after Oleshky ceasefire
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian and Ukrainian delegations -
OL,7,Fmade up of ombudsmen who were involved
OL,8,Fin the evacuation mission as well as
OL,9,Fsenior officials - are due to meet at
OL,10,Fthe White House on Thursday on Melania
OL,11,FTrump's invitation.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
